Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.48,0:21:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,0)\blur1.5\an8\fs56\3c&H000000&\3a&H5D&}本字幕由喵萌奶茶屋制作  仅供交流试看之用  请勿用于商业用途\N翻译：飞鱼　校对：Nemeton　后期：MIR
Comment: 0,0:00:00.67,0:00:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Dialogue
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.12,0:00:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}反应堆
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.13,0:00:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,功{\fsp8}率{\r}22{\fsp8}0{\r}万千瓦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.85,0:00:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,能量高达普通核电站{\fsp8}的{\r}1.{\fsp8}5{\r}倍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.91,0:00:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,作为燃料{\fsp8}的{\r}Kuborium
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.08,0:00:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是能通过核聚变产生无限热量的新能源
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,清洁且低成本
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.51,0:00:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,现{\fsp8}在{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}城的能源成本
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.68,0:00:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,比起以往竟减少{\fsp8}了{\r}80%
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.78,0:00:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,重绘世界的明天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}反应堆
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.08,0:00:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样 部长
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.14,0:00:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,如果能取得能源部的援助
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.26,0:00:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,就能建造更多发电站
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.42,0:00:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不能急进
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.45,0:00:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,想在沿海地区搞建设
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.22,0:00:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,会受渔业和环境团体强烈反对
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.77,0:00:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,就算政府批准…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.79,0:00:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,请您不要小瞧我们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.80,0:01:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,前些天成立{\fsp8}了{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}反应堆的顾问委员会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.24,0:01:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,成员… 有这些人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.51,0:01:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.44,0:01:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,反感换个说法就是强烈的关注
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.92,0:01:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这些看法很容易就能转变
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.23,0:01:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那些人不可能同意
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.54,0:01:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你花了多少钱拿下他们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.94,0:01:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,钱?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.85,0:01:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,欲速则不达
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.77,0:01:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,才不是那种无聊的手段
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.26,0:01:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过了 不要小瞧我们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.58,0:01:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,山路为这个计划提供了组织的武力支援
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.86,0:01:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,支{\fsp8}援{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}支配能源设施 从内部控制国家的野心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.44,0:02:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我当上干部后 明白组织已变成屈从{\fsp8}于{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}的傀儡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.96,0:02:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经丧失了忍者的荣誉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.69,0:02:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,所以这也是宿命
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.45,0:02:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我的监视会为你提供助力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.15,0:03:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想听你说这些事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.94,0:04:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,忍者? 这下岂不更危险了?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.97,0:04:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶 可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.60,0:04:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,现在哪还有时间害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.05,0:04:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这里也是 说不准他们何时攻过来…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.79,0:04:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不都是你的错吗 把我卷进来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.58,0:04:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,像之前那样一个人当黑客就安全吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.95,0:04:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,和他们作对就会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.84,0:04:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,当你决定做了 就只能一路走到黑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.63,0:04:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,所以求你了 用你的怨念帮助我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.94,0:04:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那你可得保护好我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.64,0:04:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 不过为此…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.53,0:04:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,需要设备
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.79,0:04:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 在那个名单上的艾玛 是什么来头
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.74,0:05:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 拜恐怖分子所赐 已经一团糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.41,0:05:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,开始
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.74,0:05:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.43,0:05:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,快派无人机
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.82,0:05:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.70,0:05:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这边的系统也宕机了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.33,0:05:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,山路现在在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.45,0:06:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 但他们肯定在赶计划
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.51,0:06:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们的行动造成的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.42,0:06:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,所以赶紧进行下一步吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.47,0:06:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,去建设中的发电站 拿到具足装备的能源
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.54,0:06:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,应该有能搬走的容器
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.14,0:06:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,运转测试?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.69,0:06:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.56,0:06:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,预定明天进行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.69,0:06:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,有情报说为了确认具足装备的反应
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.23,0:06:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,会有一名干部到场
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.46,0:06:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,干部吗 让他吐出山路的位置吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.38,0:06:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,前阵子的战斗很理想
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.16,0:06:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,要重视那份感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.57,0:06:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,思绪没有干扰的话 就能让具足装备运转更顺畅
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.11,0:06:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你要驯服怒火
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.67,0:06:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,怒火…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.54,0:06:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不会简单平息
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.18,0:07:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,冷冽如火 炽热如冰
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.66,0:07:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,鞠那时想对你说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.63,0:07:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,「活下去」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.30,0:07:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,具足装备的战斗表现
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.93,0:07:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,会回应他的意志 他的心境
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.91,0:07:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.72,0:07:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我会保护他
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.61,0:08:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样 国防部长
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.31,0:08:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然现在电池系统的极限只有5分钟左右
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.13,0:08:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,但只要能解放最大火力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.96,0:08:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,就能有这般表现
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.20,0:08:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.93,0:08:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,忍者的威胁
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.21,0:08:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那么按照计划 开始运转测试
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.49,0:08:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,三 二 一
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.91,0:09:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.77,0:09:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,成功拿到小型能量容器
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.61,0:09:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就去你那边
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.93,0:09:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好想见你啊 叛徒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.42,0:09:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,别想跑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.25,0:09:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此 是战士
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.19,0:09:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我就想和你这样的人战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.62,0:09:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,在现身的战士面前
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.09,0:09:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会跑 也不会躲藏
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.26,0:10:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,来堂堂正正打一场吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.46,0:10:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你想要什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.16,0:10:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是首领的所在地吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.62,0:10:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,打倒我 我一定会告诉你的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.76,0:10:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.70,0:10:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,美丽如我 不想在战斗中留下遗恨
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.34,0:10:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.46,0:10:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,就算如此
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.23,0:10:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,事实是我们不得不正面迎敌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.97,0:10:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.58,0:10:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,来场美丽的战斗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.93,0:10:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,对方肯定藏了一手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.87,0:10:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,在他下手前 有办法能掌控战局吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.25,0:11:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,反应堆系统
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.44,0:11:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说 如果我能切断持续无线供能的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.30,0:12:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,系统关了 供能被切断
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.32,0:13:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我叫增援的话 你们会死
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.61,0:13:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不会对战士做那种事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.88,0:13:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,下次再来场没有干扰的美丽战斗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.48,0:13:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我有一件事想问
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.24,0:13:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.86,0:13:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么为了保护我做到这个份上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.33,0:13:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你说过想完成鞠的遗愿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.36,0:13:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但她也没要求你这么做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.54,0:13:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,对 这是我的私心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.54,0:13:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我对自己的许诺
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.88,0:13:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,无论怎样都要完成
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.87,0:13:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,在鞠死后 我就下定决心了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.64,0:13:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我不指望你理解
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.03,0:13:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我该做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.68,0:14:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,鞠那时想对你说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.17,0:14:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,「活下去」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.24,0:14:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,该做的事…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.54,0:14:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我的设备 被启动了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.82,0:14:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,组织吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.99,0:14:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这么想确实在理
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.14,0:14:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,该不会…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.20,0:14:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这么轻松弄到手真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.42,0:14:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,FBI的头衔还挺管用
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.00,0:14:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.31,0:14:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这个能用多久
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.42,0:14:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,已经没法回头了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.82,0:14:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是FBI不重要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.71,0:14:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,保护市民是我自身的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.13,0:14:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 没法再深入了 保护太严密
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.44,0:14:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,看来需要费一番功夫了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.99,0:15:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,有这种技术 她果然不一般
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.25,0:15:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那个叫艾玛的 不对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.17,0:15:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,也许吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.76,0:15:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好好开车啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.34,0:15:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么突然播放音频了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.36,0:15:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这首歌…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.55,0:15:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 新人 知道我为什么叫你来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.99,0:15:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.86,0:15:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我要说教了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.13,0:15:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你总喜欢擅自行动
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.83,0:15:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你很上心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.81,0:15:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,也知道你很努力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.56,0:15:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我擅自行动能行 所以我才那样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.65,0:15:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,有时判断稍迟一些 会导致失败
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.61,0:15:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我说的不是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.73,0:15:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我在说你不够相信他人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.96,0:15:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,没有这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.69,0:15:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,有
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.52,0:15:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.57,0:15:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,有
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.42,0:16:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 你以为我干了多少年搜查官
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.51,0:16:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,多依靠点前辈吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.85,0:16:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,搭档这玩意 就像家人一样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.38,0:16:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.21,0:16:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.79,0:16:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,前辈又不是我的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.33,0:16:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你这说的什么话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.33,0:16:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,亏我带你出来喝酒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.80,0:16:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这破地方 不合我兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.73,0:16:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这里氛围多好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.70,0:16:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,而且还放着一首好歌
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.29,0:17:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,追来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.64,0:17:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,听好了 别随便跑出去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.65,0:17:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,等我信号
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.72,0:17:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这蠢货
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.08,0:17:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,呦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.00,0:18:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此 没想到你竟然是忍者
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.46,0:18:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你{\fsp8}和{\r}FB{\fsp8}I{\r}串通了是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.26,0:18:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不 FB{\fsp8}I{\r}里没人知道实情
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.44,0:18:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是受命于组织…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.14,0:18:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,作为间谍前来?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.79,0:18:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是我道歉就能获得原谅的事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.75,0:18:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来也没想寻求原谅
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.66,0:18:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.45,0:18:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,就算你这么说 我可接受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.16,0:18:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,让我跑去找这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.28,0:18:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,也是为了让我远离真相吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.97,0:18:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你背叛的是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.55,0:18:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我的 我的…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.89,0:18:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 让我独自静一会
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.03,0:18:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我得好好想想
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.38,0:19:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好疼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.82,0:19:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 一直瞒着你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.55,0:19:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你也有该做的事 不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.84,0:19:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这是?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.02,0:19:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我也有该做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.24,0:19:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我没能保护好的 死于事故的女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.46,0:19:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,留给我的话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.54,0:19:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,像阴魂不散的诅咒一般
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.62,0:19:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,「不这样的话 不这么做的话」
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.75,0:19:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我总是这样想
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.01,0:19:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,人啊 都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.31,0:19:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,背负着某种诅咒生活
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.15,0:19:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是这样 不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.12,0:20:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,本来让我恼火的 不是你瞒着我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.75,0:20:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过了 多依靠点前辈
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.70,0:20:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,画得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.13,0:20:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得它是诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.01,0:20:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但有时它说不定会成为你的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.97,0:20:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要久违地喝一杯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.39,0:20:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,疼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.16,0:20:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}建的发电站越来越多
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.35,0:20:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他们打算取代这个国家的中枢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.14,0:20:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,忍者是用于成事的武力吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.49,0:20:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.90,0:20:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,什么时候把技术发展到这个地步的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.84,0:20:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,太过厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.54,0:20:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这些图像反而没法当作证据
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.28,0:20:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,会被当成假的无视掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.41,0:20:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 我们不能就这样坐视不管
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.40,0:21:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,计划一旦完成 就意味着这个国家将被终结
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.90,0:21:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这帮混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.01,0:21:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,总之 请隐瞒这事故
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.61,0:21:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,或者请发表些让市民安心的言论
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.70,0:21:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好的好的 没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.94,0:21:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这点事不会影响到我们的信誉
Comment: 0,0:00:00.67,0:00:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Comment
Comment: 0,0:00:00.67,0:00:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Screen
Comment: 0,0:00:00.67,0:00:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,IN
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.74,0:16:48.93,Default,,0,30,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)\an9\fnAvenir Next W1G\fax-0.1\3c&HAF6F1F&\b1} Baby,  ’cause you are my girlfriend
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.93,0:16:51.72,Default,,0,30,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)\an9\fnAvenir Next W1G\fax-0.1\3c&HAF6F1F&\b1} And you're so sweet
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.72,0:16:57.94,Default,,0,30,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)\an9\fnAvenir Next W1G\fax-0.1\3c&HAF6F1F&\b1} And maybe, you are my one and only
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.94,0:17:00.71,Default,,0,30,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)\an9\fnAvenir Next W1G\fax-0.1\3c&HAF6F1F&\b1} I feel the same way
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.71,0:17:07.06,Default,,0,30,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)\an9\fnAvenir Next W1G\fax-0.1\3c&HAF6F1F&\b1} Tell me, who do you want to stay with
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.06,0:17:09.78,Default,,0,30,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)\an9\fnAvenir Next W1G\fax-0.1\3c&HAF6F1F&\b1} You know that it’s you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.78,0:17:15.81,Default,,0,30,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)\an9\fnAvenir Next W1G\fax-0.1\3c&HAF6F1F&\b1} Let me love you more and more
Comment: 0,0:00:00.67,0:00:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.66,0:21:45.17,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}As the memories fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.79,0:21:50.50,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}The lives of those who weren’t saved
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.17,0:21:55.76,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Regret and torment has come to stay
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.43,0:22:00.51,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Hopelessly leading us astray
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.06,0:22:08.19,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}On a journey to find some kind of reason
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.19,0:22:13.11,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}The army’s weight is only crumbling
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.69,0:22:17.66,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Haunted by the look of those who we’ve left behind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.66,0:22:22.87,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Close your eyes, try to leave the shame behind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.87,0:22:28.17,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Who will stay to lend a helping hand
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.75,0:22:33.30,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}When death is knocking at the door
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.67,0:22:38.64,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Who will fight alone for what is right
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.30,0:22:43.31,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}For the ones who were left behind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.31,0:22:46.27,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Those who were left behind
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.66,0:21:45.17,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}当记忆渐渐模糊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.79,0:21:50.50,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}那些未被挽救的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.17,0:21:55.76,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}后悔与折磨长留心中
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.43,0:22:00.51,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}使我们绝望迷失
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.06,0:22:08.19,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}在寻找理由的旅途之中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.19,0:22:13.11,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}当队伍开始分崩离析
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.69,0:22:17.66,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}被抛弃之人的面庞挥之不去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.66,0:22:22.87,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}闭上眼睛想忘记愧疚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.87,0:22:28.17,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}谁会留下伸出援手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.75,0:22:33.30,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}当死亡已经近在咫尺
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.67,0:22:38.64,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}谁会独自战斗追寻正义
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.30,0:22:43.31,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}为那些被抛弃的人们
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.31,0:22:46.27,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}那些被抛弃的人们
Comment: 0,0:00:00.67,0:00:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,
